"edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.6;endArrow=open;endFill=0;exitX=0.0;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.5;entryY=1.0;exitPerimeter=0;entryPerimeter=0;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1325" y="1265" /><mxPoint x="1325" y="235" /><mxPoint x="1520" y="235" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="t0" vertex="1" parent="1" value="46 | 조회가 원본 결합을 실행 vs 생산된 관계를 조회" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=36;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="20" width="2480" height="46.800000000000004" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t1" vertex="1" parent="1" value="같은 W46/r1, a와 b, S1/P1→S2/P2, E20/P20와 D21/D22 | 화살표는 발생 입력, 읽기, 구성, 쓰기와 반환을 구별" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=24;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="75" width="2480" height="31.200000000000003" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t2" vertex="1" parent="1" value="A  현재 요청에서 원본을 읽고 요청별 결과를 구성" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=28;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="20" y="120" width="1210" height="36.4" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t3" vertex="1" parent="1" value="입력 refs가 전달됨. 현재 의미/Task는 미확정. 유효 cache와 prefetch도 허용." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="175" width="1190" height="28.6" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t4" vertex="1" parent="1" value="1 Q46 요청 범위 결정" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="90" y="430" width="365" height="24.7" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t5" vertex="1" parent="1" value="2 Q1이 원본 결합을 요청" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="730" y="832" width="475" height="26.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t6" vertex="1" parent="1" value="3 원본 구간 read" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="530" y="965" width="185" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t7" vertex="1" parent="1" value="r1/span read" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="570" y="1090" width="140" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t8" vertex="1" parent="1" value="4 이번 query의 후보 구성" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="115" y="1054" width="265" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t9" vertex="1" parent="1" value="5 과거 owner read&lt;br&gt;필요 시 의미 가공" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="470" y="710" width="260" height="49.4" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t10" vertex="1" parent="1" value="유효 cache로 같은 과거 owner read를 생략할 수 있음" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="95" y="768" width="620" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t11" vertex="1" parent="1" value="6 Q1 결과와 과거 refs를 조합" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="795" y="587" width="385" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t12" vertex="1" parent="1" value="준비 조건: 필요한 원본 read/join 또는 유효 cache + 요청별 Set 완료&lt;br&gt;정정 r2: 영향 query/set/cache 차단 → 필요한 원본부터 다시 구성" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1270" width="1190" height="57.2" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t13" vertex="1" parent="1" value="7 현재 의미/Task 제안과 Request Controller의 채택은 공통. 시간 후보 ≠ 지칭 정답." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1362" width="1190" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t14" vertex="1" parent="1" value="B  owner별 관계 생산 경로와 관계 소비 경로" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=28;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1320" y="120" width="1210" height="36.4" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t15" vertex="1" parent="1" value="1 원본/전사 revision 변화" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1395" y="558" width="310" height="26.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t16" vertex="1" parent="1" value="2 지원 시간 관계 구성 → 조건부 게시" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1395" y="682" width="470" height="26.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t17" vertex="1" parent="1" value="3 확정 기록 변화 → read/필요한 의미 추출" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1985" y="575" width="510" height="26.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t18" vertex="1" parent="1" value="4 과거 관계 구성 → 조건부 게시" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1985" y="685" width="510" height="26.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t19" vertex="1" parent="1" value="5 TEv1 유효성/coverage 확인 후 read" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1400" y="930" width="455" height="26.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t20" vertex="1" parent="1" value="5 HMv7 유효성/coverage 확인 후 read" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1985" y="930" width="510" height="26.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t21" vertex="1" parent="1" value="미게시면 2 생산/게시 후 재조회" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1400" y="957" width="455" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t22" vertex="1" parent="1" value="미게시면 4 생산/게시 후 재조회" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1985" y="957" width="510" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t23" vertex="1" parent="1" value="6 게시된 두 자료를 선택해 Bundle 반환&lt;br&gt;Reader는 raw 시간/과거 관계를 재구성하지 않음" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1975" y="1190" width="540" height="52.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t24" vertex="1" parent="1" value="미게시면 생산 요청 → 게시 후 재조회. NOT_COVERED와 UNSUPPORTED 구별." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=20;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="1330" width="1190" height="26.0" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t25" vertex="1" parent="1" value="7 현재 의미/Task 제안과 Request Controller의 채택은 공통. 시간 후보 ≠ 지칭 정답." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1340" y="1362" width="1190" height="23.400000000000002" /></mxCell><mxCell id="t26" vertex="1" parent="1" value="범례: 직각 Component / 둥근 Module / 원통 owner 상태 / 문서형 실제 교환 자료 / 살구색 차이 / 점선 유효 cache 또는 미게시의 조건 경로&lt;br&gt;공통: capture/시각 정규화. 시간 관계 구성은 코드 / 과거 의미 가공은 조건부 C-CONTEXT / 현재 의미는 C-INTERPRET → Model Access의 cloud 모델." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontSize=17;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Apple SD Gothic Neo;"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1390" width="2470" height="44.2" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
